host_about:
I simply love living in the heart of Copenhagen. I have lived here for 19 years, and I don't think I'm ever gonna move. I have everything just around the corner - and as you now know a spacious quiet garden to relax in whenever I feel like it. I enjoy exploring art and design exhibitions, love listening to live music and dance lindyhop - you can find plenty of that here in CPH. Just let me know if you need any recommendations. 

Looking forward meeting you
// Maria

Vi er et par på 33 og 35, samt en dreng på 4 år og nyeste skud på stammen, vores lille pige på 2 måneder. 

Vi bruger meget af vores tid på at rejse i forbindelse med arbejde, samt af ren interesse. Vi lejer lejligheden ud til tider, hvor vi begge er væk. Dog stadig med garanti for rengøring og velkomst. 

//Philip og Sarah

I am indian and I m living in Denmark with my husband. I m house wife so taking care of household. I have 10 years experience of hotel industry. I have worked as team leader in food and beverage department in India . hospitality is my passion.
{ indian hospitality in Denmark}

India is country which has culture and tradition to treat guest like God. In Sanskrit ATITHI DEVO BHAVAH means guest is like God. We follow this rule . and try to give our best to make your stay memorable.
